WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.280
- I just met the Yodeling Kid.

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.113
- Oh my god,

00:00:02.113 --> 00:00:04.110
I'm about to meet the Yodeling Kid.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:05.620
Hello everyone, Ivan here,

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.370
and I am at the 2018
Radio Disney Music Awards

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:12.000
asking celebs to build
their dream Disney squad.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.833
Let's go!

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.410
Who would you pick as your Disney squad?

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.190
If you have to pick like three
or four Disney characters

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:19.440
from your favorite movies

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.110
and a place you would take them.

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:23.293
- Probably Rapunzel from Tangled,

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:24.340
that'd be a first.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.413
- Simba, young Simba, definitely.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.430
- And where would you take them?

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.170
- We goin' on vacation.

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:31.447
- Where?
- Where are we going?

00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:32.280
Where are we going?

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.113
Where are we going?

00:00:33.113 --> 00:00:34.143
- Uh...
- Atlantis!

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.363
- The High School Musical squad.

00:00:35.363 --> 00:00:36.730
- Okay--
- And I'd take 'em back

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:37.847
to East High School and be like,

00:00:37.847 --> 00:00:39.937
"Yo, film High School Musical 4."

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.790
- I'm signing that petition.

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.130
- Maybe Belle from Beauty and the--

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:43.963
I mean, I dunno,

00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:44.870
that's my favorite movie,

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.460
I still got the biggest
crush on her, so...

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.700
- Take her out to dinner.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.800
- You would take her on a date, more like.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.700
- Uh...

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:52.480
I would take her more than just a date.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.957
I would literally (record scratching).

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:56.260
I'd take her to the beach or something,

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.093
I dunno.
- Oh, okay,

00:00:57.093 --> 00:00:59.140
I didn't know where that
was going for a second.

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.090
- Phineas and Ferb.

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.450
I wanna have a good summer this summer,

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.590
so Phineas and Ferb

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.610
I feel like they would help me.

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:05.380
- I would choose

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.913
Shia LaBeouf in Holes.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.493
I would choose Jett Jackson.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:11.120
- Ohh.
- I love him.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.870
I love him, I miss him, I love him.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.220
I would choose Jett Jackson

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.643
and I would choose the
guy from the Jersey, too.

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:18.536
(laughs)
- Ooh!

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:19.720
- But that's because I
grew up with all of them.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:20.650
And I want Nick Spano

00:01:20.650 --> 00:01:21.960
'cause you love me and I love you.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:22.793
Okay, cool.

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.813
- Maybe Mal from Descendants.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:26.883
- Just Mal?

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.113
That would be it?

00:01:28.113 --> 00:01:29.160
- I think Mal because, you know,

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.333
she got the eyes and she
can turn into a dragon.

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:34.553
A dragon.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.440
- But that to me sounds
more like a date with Mal

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.190
than just hanging out
with a squad. (laughs)

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:42.640
- I'd have the emperor
from Emperor's New Groove.

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.627
- Yeah.
- Yeah, that guy.

00:01:43.627 --> 00:01:46.783
- And I'd have the dude
that is his friend.

00:01:46.889 --> 00:01:48.210
- The big guy?
- The big guy, I'll be him.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.043
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:49.043 --> 00:01:51.500
- I gotta go with Hercules...

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:52.783
- Okay, cool.

00:01:52.783 --> 00:01:53.790
- Hades...

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:54.653
- Okay.

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:55.913
- Donald Duck,

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:57.883
and my girlfriend Maya.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:02:00.003
- Amazing combination.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:01.750
All right, and where would
you take all of them?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:02.583
- Where would I take them?

00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:03.670
- Yeah.
- Probably Disney World.

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:04.503
Or Disney Land.

00:02:04.503 --> 00:02:05.336
- You're a big fan?

00:02:05.336 --> 00:02:06.330
- Of course.
- Me, too!

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.163
- Yeah.

00:02:07.163 --> 00:02:08.060
We should go together!
- Can I join?

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:08.893
- I'd love that!

00:02:09.148 --> 00:02:09.981
Only if you wear that shirt, though.

00:02:09.981 --> 00:02:11.340
- I would wear this shirt for you any day.

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:12.840
So I'm here with Mason Ramsey,

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:13.673
I just met him,

00:02:13.673 --> 00:02:14.750
I'm super excited.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.860
We're trying to find out

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.203
who would you pick as your Disney squad?

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.720
If you have to pick like two
or three Disney characters

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:21.770
that you really like.

00:02:22.754 --> 00:02:23.587
- Uh...

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.090
- Is there any Disney movie that you like?

00:02:27.350 --> 00:02:28.183
- Yeah?

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:29.810
When I was three

00:02:30.188 --> 00:02:32.051
(children yelling)

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.400
I'll just flat-out tell
you the truth, all right?

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.233
- Okay, tell me the truth.

00:02:35.233 --> 00:02:36.317
- So when I go home,

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.400
I'm not allowed to watch TV.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:39.233
- If you have a squad,

00:02:39.233 --> 00:02:40.400
where would you take your squad?

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.493
Go home and chill?

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:43.667
- And play video games.

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:44.500
- Oh!

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.333
- Mulan.

00:02:45.369 --> 00:02:46.817
- Oh, Mulan, easily.
- Original feminist icon.

00:02:46.817 --> 00:02:47.650
Hello.

00:02:47.696 --> 00:02:48.897
- Captain Jack, I guess?

00:02:48.897 --> 00:02:49.730
- Okay.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:50.876
- Jack Sparrow, I like that.

00:02:50.876 --> 00:02:51.709
Jack Sparrow's Disney.

00:02:51.709 --> 00:02:52.709
- And Ariel.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:53.613
- Kim Possible.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:54.670
Love Kim Possible.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:56.370
Raven-Symone, who I work with,

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.160
but she'd be amazing in a Disney squad.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.010
- She's already a squad, I feel like.

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:01.340
- We already form our own squad

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.570
within our cast, so yeah.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.713
But that's a ideal Disney
squad, if you will.

00:03:05.808 --> 00:03:08.808
(upbeat horn music)

